      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    closing_prices = [102, 100, 105, 107, 103]\n    trading_volumes = [1500, 1600, 1400, 1300, 1350]\n    nvi = 1000.0\n\n    # Calculate NVI for each day after the first\n    for day in range(1, len(closing_prices)):\n        if trading_volumes[day] < trading_volumes[day - 1]:\n            price_change_ratio = (\n                (closing_prices[day] - closing_prices[day - 1])\n                / closing_prices[day - 1]\n            )\n            nvi += price_change_ratio * nvi\n\n    # Return the NVI after five days, rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(nvi, 2)\n```",
